diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b677f4e..cf67464 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,10 @@ A small expense ledger. Entries live in a JSON file (`--data` or `$LEDGER_DATA`)
 
     python -m ledger add 2026-01-05 12.50 food "lunch"
     python -m ledger list
+    python -m ledger list --limit 10
     python -m ledger report --by month
 
+`list --limit N` shows at most the N most recent entries by date, oldest first.
+N must be a positive integer. Without `--limit`, all entries are shown.
+
 Tests: `python -m unittest discover -s tests`.
